# Development Rules

- No hardcoded secrets; do not commit `.env` or credential files.
- No `git push --force` to `main` or `master`.
- Bug fixes require a regression test when the project already has tests.
- New behavior requires tests where the repo uses a test runner.
- Do not delete or skip tests to make CI pass.
- Prefer minimal diffs — do not refactor unrelated code in the same change.
